  "title": "Chocolate Chip Shortbread Cookies II",
  "description": "Shortbread cookies with chocolate chips and pecans. If you don't like pecans, you could add toasted coconut instead. Don't be put off by the amount of butter, this recipe makes a very large batch.",
  "authors": [
    "Lindy"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:42:39-04:00",
